Verified at 390x720 in EN and FA: headings match the spec ("Who do you
support?" / "چه کسی را حمایت می‌کنی؟", "Pick up to four more clubs",
"Follow up to five leagues"), continue is gated on step 1 and always
enabled on the optional steps, rows meet the 44px target, and each step
already fades in (rise-in) instead of snapping. Fixes:
- hardware back now walks the picker back a step instead of closing the
  mini app — /onboarding is a tab root for the shared hook, so the picker
  owns the Telegram BackButton while the user sits deeper than step 1;
- count chips and the step label now carry Persian digits in FA
  («گام ۲ از ۳», «۱ از ۵») via Intl.NumberFormat(fa-IR) — Latin numerals
  broke the bidi run.

No search input exists in the picker by design (grouped Segmented tabs);
per spec it was verified, not added.

